  {:id :equality-default-strict,
   :title "= on cross-type numbers follows Clojure (JVM), not JVM =",
   :category-id :numeric-tower,
   :rationale
   "= remains a value-equality predicate; numeric\n                    equality across float / int is what Clojure (JVM)\n                    specifies, not JVM-Object-equality.",
