  {:id :iterate-chunking,
   :title "Sequence chunking is deterministic but not always 32",
   :category-id :collections,
   :rationale
   "Lazy realization batch size is implementation-\n                    defined in Clojure (JVM); mino picks sizes that suit the\n                    embedded use case. Code that depends on exact\n                    chunk boundaries is non-portable in Clojure (JVM) too.",
